sequenceDiagram
  participant Dev as 開發者
  participant App as app.go
  participant Runner as evidence.Run
  participant EJ as evidence journal
  participant Gate as gate.Service
  participant Esc as escalation.Service
  Dev->>App: commit test_commit（oracle-surface 範圍內）
  Dev->>App: RegisterMutation(taskRef, patch)
  App->>EJ: append mutation
  Dev->>App: RunEvidence(expected_red, test_commit)
  App->>Runner: Run(RunSpec kind=expected_red)
  Runner-->>App: EvidenceRun（result）
  App->>EJ: append EvidenceRun
  App->>Esc: wireEvidenceEscalation（passed／error／failed）
  Dev->>App: RunEvidence(negative_control, test_commit, mutationID)
  App->>Runner: Run(RunSpec kind=negative_control)
  Runner-->>App: EvidenceRun（result）
  App->>EJ: append EvidenceRun
  App->>Esc: wireEvidenceEscalation
  Dev->>App: SubmitTestContract(...)
  App->>Gate: Submit(test_contract_approval, subject, bindings)
  Gate-->>App: approval_id（pending）
  Dev->>App: GateDecide(approval_id, approved)
  Note over App,Gate: §3.10 凍結順序
  App->>Gate: 1. reconcile bindings
  App->>Gate: 2. PrepareDecision（TCAPolicy 硬性 validator）
  App->>Esc: 2b. escResolveByKey（修復解除）
  App->>Esc: 3. escBlockingFor（blocking 檢查）
  App->>Gate: 4. CommitDecision（append）
  Gate-->>App: active
